	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Salutem multam, doctissime simul et charissime in Christo domine.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Scripsit ad nos his diebus d. <persName ref="p6">Abelus</persName>, mercator <placeName ref="l830">Anglus</placeName>, ex <lb xml:id="p1z3"/><placeName ref="l491">Argentina</placeName>; in quibus suis ad nos literis aliae continebantur <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ad te, ad d. <persName ref="p2827">Simlerum</persName> et <persName ref="p8011">Gvalterum</persName>, et <persName ref="p1283">Gesnerum</persName> literae <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ex <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> scriptae.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quae si ad vos pervenerint, cupio nostras <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>literas in quibus illae continebantur huc ad nos mitti.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Si non pervenerint, nolebam id vos nescire tamen: id enim <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>ex alteris iam <persName ref="p6">Abeli</persName> literis ad nos scriptis intelleximus.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Literae illae, quantum intelligo, mense martio ad vos ex <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>destinatae sunt, ad nos mense aprili mittebantur; iamque <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>mense maio de non redditis intelligimus.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Scripseram praeterea <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>d. <persName ref="p1183">Fre[n]shamo</persName> istic apud vos aprilis 23; nec scio an <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>redditae sint illi literae.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Et de valetudine eius valde <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>scire cupio.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Tua praestantia dignabitur eum hac de re <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>admonere, simul et imbecillitatem illius sublevare, quod <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>poteris, si quid laboret.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">In historiis martyrum colligendis <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>hic tumultuor pro viribus, ac ferme supra vires.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Qua in <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>re si quid poteris, nos adiutes velim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Poteris autem, si cum d. <lb xml:id="p1z19"/><persName ref="p2336">Bernardino</persName> istic caeterisque <placeName ref="l834">Italis</placeName> agas, ut si quid habeant rerum <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>huiusmodi ex <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> breviter annotatum velint; deinde si quid <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>tua etiam memoria de rebus in vestro confinio gestis teneat, nomina <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>saltem et oppida paucis consignare volueris.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Nam etsi in <placeName ref="l830">Britannicis</placeName> maxime <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>laboramus, caeterarum tamen gentium sacras historias, si contingant, non praeteri<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>emus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">D. Iesus salutem tuam, studia et labores, dirigat ad gloriam ipsius!</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/><placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName>, pridie pentecostes, 1559.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Tuus in Christo, <persName ref="p1145">Ioan. Foxus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Doctissimo ac integerrimo <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>viro d. <persName ref="p495">Henrico <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullingero</persName>, apud <lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinos</placeName> ecclesiastae.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
